  <div class="container">

    <!-- OVERVIEW -->
    <section id="overview">
      <h2>📋 Overview — Inbound Is Now the Focus</h2>
      <p>Inbound calls are now the <strong>primary activity</strong> for Hearing Benefit Services. Every incoming call is logged with a <strong>disposition</strong> — a code that tells the system what the call was about and what to do next.</p>
      <div class="warn-box">
        ⚠️ <strong>This is not a sales script.</strong> Your job is to answer the call, help the caller, and pick the correct disposition so the system routes the call correctly. The system does the rest automatically.
      </div>
      <p>When you log a disposition on a call, the system automatically:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Moves the caller's record to the correct stage in the <strong>Call Management</strong> pipeline</li>
        <li>Adds a note to the record (the record of that call)</li>
        <li>Applies a tag to the contact for future tracking</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Your only job is to <strong>pick the right disposition</strong>. Everything else happens on its own.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- THE 10 DISPOSITIONS -->
    <section id="dispositions">
      <h2>🎯 The 10 Inbound Dispositions</h2>
      <p>When an inbound call ends, choose the disposition that best describes the call. There are <strong>10</strong> to choose from:</p>
      <table class="action-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Disposition</th><th>What It Means</th><th>What the System Does</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">New Sales Inquiry</span></td><td>A new or potential customer asking about hearing aids, pricing, or services</td><td>Moves to Sales Inquiry — Routed, tags <code>inbound_sales</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Existing Customer — Support</span></td><td>An existing customer needs help with their hearing aids</td><td>Moves to Support / Repair — Routed, tags <code>inbound_support</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Repair Request</span></td><td>Customer needs a repair on their hearing aids</td><td>Moves to Support / Repair — Routed, tags <code>inbound_repair</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Warranty / Insurance</span></td><td>Customer asking about warranty or insurance coverage</td><td>Moves to Warranty / Insurance — Routed, tags <code>inbound_warranty</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Order Status</span></td><td>Customer asking about a pending order or shipping</td><td>Moves to Order Status — Routed, tags <code>inbound_order_status</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-green">Appointment</span></td><td>Caller wants to book, reschedule, or confirm an appointment</td><td>Moves to Appointment Handled, tags <code>inbound_appointment</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Billing / Payment</span></td><td>Customer asking about a bill, payment, or financing</td><td>Moves to Billing / Financing — Routed, tags <code>inbound_billing</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-yellow">Spanish</span></td><td>Caller prefers to communicate in Spanish</td><td>Moves to Spanish — Routed, tags <code>spanish_request</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-red">Not Relevant / Spam</span></td><td>Sales call, wrong number, or spam — not a real customer</td><td>Moves to Not Relevant / Spam, tags <code>inbound_spam</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-gray">No Answer / Voicemail Left</span></td><td>You called someone back and they did not answer</td><td>Moves to Missed — Callback Needed, tags <code>inbound_callback</code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <div class="info-box">
        💡 <strong>Not sure which to pick?</strong> Ask yourself: <em>"Why is this person calling?"</em> The answer maps to one of the 10 dispositions above.
      </div>

      <h3>Two Dispositions to Watch</h3>
      <div class="warn-box">
        ⚠️ <strong>Not Relevant / Spam</strong> — this is terminal. No follow-up happens. Use it only for genuine spam, sales calls, or wrong numbers — <strong>not</strong> for a customer you simply couldn't help.
      </div>
      <div class="warn-box">
        ⚠️ <strong>No Answer / Voicemail Left</strong> — this is <strong>only</strong> for when <em>you</em> call someone back and <em>they</em> don't answer. It is <strong>not</strong> for an inbound call that went unanswered (that is handled separately).
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PIPELINE STAGES -->
    <section id="pipeline">
      <h2>📊 The Call Management Pipeline</h2>
      <p>Every inbound call is tracked in the <strong>Call Management</strong> pipeline. Each disposition moves the caller to a specific stage:</p>
      <table class="action-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>What It Means</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-gray">New Inbound Call</span></td><td>Every inbound call lands here first (triage entry)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Sales Inquiry — Routed</span></td><td>New sales inquiry</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Support / Repair — Routed</span></td><td>Existing customer support or repair request</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Warranty / Insurance — Routed</span></td><td>Warranty or insurance question</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Order Status — Routed</span></td><td>Order or shipping question</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-green">Appointment Handled</span></td><td>Appointment booked, rescheduled, or confirmed</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Billing / Financing — Routed</span></td><td>Billing, payment, or financing question</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-yellow">Spanish — Routed</span></td><td>Caller prefers Spanish</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-gray">Resolved — No Further Action</span></td><td>Call fully handled — no follow-up needed</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-red">Missed — Callback Needed</span></td><td>Callback is needed</td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-red">Not Relevant / Spam</span></td><td>Spam, sales call, or wrong number</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <!-- WHAT HAPPENS AUTOMATICALLY -->
    <section id="what-happens">
      <h2>⚙️ What Happens Automatically</h2>
      <p>Each disposition triggers an automated workflow. You don't build these — they run on their own. Here's what happens when you log each disposition:</p>
      <table class="action-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Disposition</th><th>Automatic Actions</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">New Sales Inquiry</span></td><td>Move to Sales Inquiry → add note → tag <code>inbound_sales</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Existing Customer — Support</span></td><td>Move to Support / Repair → add note → tag <code>inbound_support</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Repair Request</span></td><td>Move to Support / Repair → add note → tag <code>inbound_repair</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Warranty / Insurance</span></td><td>Move to Warranty / Insurance → add note → tag <code>inbound_warranty</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Order Status</span></td><td>Move to Order Status → add note → tag <code>inbound_order_status</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-green">Appointment</span></td><td>Move to Appointment Handled → add note → tag <code>inbound_appointment</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-blue">Billing / Payment</span></td><td>Move to Billing / Financing → add note → tag <code>inbound_billing</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-yellow">Spanish</span></td><td>Move to Spanish — Routed → add note → tag <code>spanish_request</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-red">Not Relevant / Spam</span></td><td>Move to Not Relevant / Spam → add note → tag <code>inbound_spam</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span class="chip chip-gray">No Answer / Voicemail Left</span></td><td>Move to Missed — Callback Needed → add note → tag <code>inbound_callback</code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="success-box">
        ✅ <strong>One call = one note.</strong> Every call gets exactly one note on the record — that note is the record of the call. No extra reminders, no duplicate notes.
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW TO LOG A CALL -->
    <section id="how-to">
      <h2>📞 How to Log an Inbound Call</h2>
      <p>Follow these steps every time you handle an inbound call:</p>
      <div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">1</span><p>Answer the call and help the caller as you normally would</p></div>
      <div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">2</span><p>When the call ends, open the call record in <strong>Conversations</strong></p></div>
      <div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">3</span><p>Click the <strong>disposition</strong> field</p></div>
      <div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">4</span><p>Select the disposition that best matches the call (see the 10 above)</p></div>
      <div class="step-row"><span class="step-num">5</span><p>Save — the system moves the caller, adds the note, and tags them automatically</p></div>

      <div class="warn-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
        ⚠️ <strong>Pick the disposition that matches the call.</strong> The whole routing depends on your choice. When in doubt, ask: <em>"What is this person calling about?"</em>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- DAILY CHECKLIST -->
    <section id="checklist">
      <h2>✅ Your Daily Checklist</h2>
      <p>Use this every day while inbound calls are active:</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Log in to MDRev.AI and check your <strong>Tasks</strong> — complete any overdue tasks first</li>
        <li>Check the <strong>Call Management pipeline</strong> — review anyone in Missed — Callback Needed</li>
        <li>Check your <strong>Conversations inbox</strong> — reply to any inbound messages within 24 hours</li>
        <li>Log a disposition on every inbound call you take</li>
        <li>If a caller prefers Spanish — pick the Spanish disposition so they're routed correctly</li>
        <li>Mark all completed tasks as done to keep the pipeline clean</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

